      "start_seconds": 248.38,
      "end_seconds": 267.36,
      "duration_seconds": 18.98,
      "text": "it's reasonable to be concerned, but right now possible cerebral venous thrombosis is my leading thought, not anything worse. Let's book an MRI of the head to look into papilloedema. Let's book an urgent CT venogram to look into possible venous thrombosis"
    },
