      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 273.07,
      "end_seconds": 286.01,
      "duration_seconds": 12.94,
      "text": "stop the pill, you need an urgent scan and admission try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed"
